00:44:48,740 --> 00:44:53,940
discussions. Yes, learners should practice using them. Now let's practice a full

775
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:58,900
business performance description. Good idea. Our company experienced strong

776
00:44:58,900 --> 00:45:03,740
performance this quarter. Revenue increased by 12% and customer

777
00:45:03,740 --> 00:45:09,020
satisfaction improved due to enhanced service quality. We also implemented

778
00:45:09,020 --> 00:45:13,980
new efficiency measures, reducing operational costs by 5%.

779
00:45:13,980 --> 00:45:19,700
Moving forward, we will continue focusing on innovation and customer experience to sustain

780
00:45:19,700 --> 00:45:20,700
growth.

781
00:45:20,700 --> 00:45:21,700
That's excellent.

782
00:45:21,700 --> 00:45:25,740
It includes results, explanations, and future plans.

783
00:45:25,740 --> 00:45:26,740
Very professional.

784
00:45:26,740 --> 00:45:29,420
Now let's talk about business meetings.

785
00:45:29,420 --> 00:45:30,540
Good topic.

786
00:45:30,540 --> 00:45:33,540
Business performance is often discussed in meetings.

787
00:45:33,540 --> 00:45:35,460
For example, performance reviews.

788
00:45:35,460 --> 00:45:38,460
A performance review evaluates results.

789
00:45:38,460 --> 00:45:41,740
It focuses on achievements and areas for improvement.

790
00:45:41,740 --> 00:45:43,180
Let's create an example.

791
00:45:43,180 --> 00:45:44,180
Okay.

792
00:45:44,180 --> 00:45:51,140
Our team achieved a 10% increase in productivity, however, we identified opportunities to improve

793
00:45:51,140 --> 00:45:52,980
process efficiency.

794
00:45:52,980 --> 00:45:58,660
We will implement new strategies to address these areas and continue driving performance.

795
00:45:58,660 --> 00:46:01,040
That sounds professional and balanced.

796
00:46:01,040 --> 00:46:03,900
It highlights success and improvement.

797
00:46:03,900 --> 00:46:04,900
Exactly.

798
00:46:04,900 --> 00:46:07,500
Now let's talk about common questions.

799
00:46:07,500 --> 00:46:08,500
Good question.

800
00:46:08,500 --> 00:46:09,500
Question.

801
00:46:09,500 --> 00:46:11,460
How is your company performing?

802
00:46:11,460 --> 00:46:12,620
Answer.

803
00:46:12,620 --> 00:46:15,860
Performance has improved due to strategic initiatives.

804
00:46:15,860 --> 00:46:16,860
Question.

805
00:46:16,860 --> 00:46:18,820
What challenges are you facing?

806
00:46:18,820 --> 00:46:19,820
Answer.

807
00:46:19,820 --> 00:46:22,340
We are addressing challenges with new solutions.

808
00:46:22,340 --> 00:46:23,340
Question.

809
00:46:23,340 --> 00:46:24,580
What are your growth plans?

810
00:46:24,580 --> 00:46:25,580
Answer.

811
00:46:25,580 --> 00:46:28,300
We plan to expand and improve efficiency.

812
00:46:28,300 --> 00:46:30,060
These answers sound professional.

813
00:46:30,060 --> 00:46:32,380
Yes, and they show confidence.

814
00:46:32,380 --> 00:46:35,100
Now let's talk about business tone.

815
00:46:35,100 --> 00:46:36,100
Good point.

816
00:46:36,100 --> 00:46:39,580
Business communication should be clear and factual.

817
00:46:39,580 --> 00:46:41,300
Avoid emotional language.

818
00:46:41,300 --> 00:46:47,500
For example, instead of saying everything is bad, say, we are addressing challenges.

819
00:46:47,500 --> 00:46:49,220
That sounds professional.

820
00:46:49,220 --> 00:46:52,020
Business discussions should focus on solutions.

821
00:46:52,020 --> 00:46:53,020
Exactly.

822
00:46:53,020 --> 00:46:54,860
Now, let's summarize.

823
00:46:54,860 --> 00:46:56,060
Good idea.

824
00:46:56,060 --> 00:46:58,700
Business performance is about results.

825
00:46:58,700 --> 00:47:00,860
Use data to describe performance.

826
00:47:00,860 --> 00:47:03,500
KPIs measure success.

827
00:47:03,500 --> 00:47:05,500
Trends show progress.

828
00:47:05,500 --> 00:47:10,820
are opportunities for improvement. Business communication should be professional.

829
00:47:10,820 --> 00:47:13,380
And clear. That's the key.

830
00:47:13,380 --> 00:47:18,360
Before we finish, let's ask a question. Yes, we love hearing from our listeners.

831
00:47:18,360 --> 00:47:21,900
How would you describe your company's performance in English?

832
00:47:21,900 --> 00:47:26,780
Try writing a short description. Include results and future goals.

833
00:47:26,780 --> 00:47:29,900
Practice makes perfect. Thank you for joining us today.

834
00:47:29,900 --> 00:47:33,380
We hope you found this useful. Talking about business performance is an

835
00:47:33,380 --> 00:47:38,540
important skill. And you are improving every day. Keep practicing. Keep learning.

836
00:47:38,540 --> 00:47:43,780
We'll see you in the next episode. Goodbye. Bye-bye.
